<h2>Practical Information</h2>
<p><strong>Hours:</strong> The village itself has no admission charge and is accessible at all hours, though the hanbok rental shops and most businesses open around 9am and close around 7pm.</p>
<p><strong>Duration:</strong> Budget 2–3 hours for a relaxed exploration of the main viewpoints and alleys, plus lunch in Samcheong-dong.</p>
<p><strong>Accessibility:</strong> The village is hilly with steep, cobbled alleys — not suitable for wheelchairs or strollers in most areas. Comfortable, flat-soled shoes are essential.</p>

